&lt;h5 class="smt_head4"&gt;③保有目的が純投資目的である投資株式&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ShareholdingsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">株式数の増加は取引先持株会への拠出等によるものであります。</jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">日清食品ホールディングス㈱</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
